{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"单纯对象"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"单纯对象"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>当范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 的对象是某种空间 (几何对象) 时, 若要用单纯形 $\\Delta^n$ 来 “探测” 一个与 $\\mathcal C$ 的对象类似的空间 $X$, 使得 “映射空间” $\\operatorname{Map}(\\Delta^n, X)$ 是 $\\mathcal C$ 的对象, 则会得到 $\\mathcal C$ 中的单纯对象 $X\\colon \\Delta^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathcal C$.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 中的<strong>单纯对象</strong>是其"},{"Local":{"url":"内部观点","text":"内部"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯集","text":"单纯集"}},{"Plain":", 也即"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯形范畴","text":"单纯形范畴"}},{"Plain":"的对偶到 $\\mathcal C$ 的函子 $\\Delta^{\\text{op}}\\to \\mathcal C$.</p>\n<p>类似地, <strong>增广单纯对象</strong>是"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯形范畴","text":"增广单纯形范畴"}},{"Plain":"的对偶到 $\\mathcal C$ 的函子 $\\Delta_+^{\\text{op}}\\to \\mathcal C$.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯集","text":"单纯集"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"常值单纯对象","text":"常值单纯对象"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"单纯对象的分裂","text":"单纯对象的分裂"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}